  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large skillet, cook Canadian bacon over medium heat until crispy.",
    "In a separate saucepan, combine vegetable broth and heavy cream. Bring to a simmer.",
    "Stir in shredded Gruyère and smoked cheddar until melted and smooth.",
    "Transfer the skillet with Canadian bacon to a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
    "Pour the cheese sauce over the Canadian bacon.",
    "Sprinkle grated gratin on top.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
